# Keep line endings fixed on every system. Bash fails on CRLF scripts, and
# git on Windows (core.autocrlf=true) would otherwise convert them on checkout.
# This file also ships inside the zip, so it protects mvn-devops/ when it is
# committed into a project.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
